B.aCL=new A.cC("Choose your language, your city and the parts of the app you want. The Home screen then shows only what you chose. Change anything later in Settings \u2192 Modules. The app works without internet.","Getting started")
B.aCa=new A.cC('Open Quran \u2192 pick a Surah or Para. Choose IndoPak or Uthmani script from the reading settings (sliders icon), where you can also make the text bigger. Every ayah shows its reference, for example 2:255. The app remembers where you stopped: tap "Continue reading" on Home.',"Reading the Quran")
B.aD2=new A.cC("Tap the bookmark icon next to an ayah, or long-press the ayah for more options: copy with reference, or report an error. Search accepts Arabic, Urdu, a surah name in any common spelling (yasin, yaseen), or a reference like 36:1.","Bookmarks, copy and search")
B.aCl=new A.cC("A translation appears only after our scholars confirm its source. Until then the reader shows a note instead of the translation.","Translation")
B.aC9=new A.cC('Choose your city, or tap "Use my current location". The default calculation is University of Islamic Sciences, Karachi, with Hanafi Asr. In Advanced mode (turn off Simple mode in Settings) you can move each time by a few minutes to match your masjid. The Hijri date can be moved \xb12 days when the local moon sighting differs.',"Namaz times")
B.aCn=new A.cC('Reminders vibrate silently. On Android allow "Alarms & reminders" and turn off battery optimisation for this app. On Xiaomi, Redmi, Oppo, Vivo, Realme and some Samsung phones also allow "Autostart" and set battery to "No restrictions", otherwise the phone may block reminders.',"Reminders not ringing?")
B.aBW=new A.cC("Hold the phone flat and away from metal, magnets and electric wires. If the arrow looks wrong, move the phone in a figure-8 a few times to calibrate the compass. The angle from North is also shown, so you can use any compass.","Qibla")
B.aCR=new A.cC("Tasbih: tap anywhere to count; choose a target of 33, 99, 100 or 1000. Namaz log: mark each prayer as on time, with jama'at, qaza or missed. Your log stays only on your phone and is never shared or compared.","Tasbih and namaz log")
B.aCi=new A.cC("No ads, no selling of data. Your location is used only on the phone to calculate times. Settings, bookmarks and your namaz log are stored on this phone.","Privacy")
B.aCc=new A.cC("Settings \u2192 About & sources lists every text source and its licence, and the editorial standard of the app. If you find a mistake, long-press the ayah \u2192 Report an error.","Sources and mistakes")
